></span>=20PAGEREF=20_b2c30fc5-9142-c31f-5952-80b91385d7a0=20\h=20<span=20s=
tyle=3D"mso-element:field-separator"></span><span=20style=3D"mso-element:fi=
eld-end"></span></p>=0A<p=20class=3DMsoNormal><br=20clear=3D"all"=20style=3D=
"mso-special-character:line-break;page-break-before:always"=20/></p>=0A<h1=20=
class=3DForewordTitle>Foreword</h1>=0A<p=20class=3DForewordText>ISO=20(the=20=
International=20Organization=20for=20Standardization)=20is=20a=20worldwide=20=
federation=20of=20national=20standards=20bodies=20(ISO=20member=20bodies).=20=
The=20work=20of=20preparing=20International=20Standards=20is=20normally=20c=
arried=20out=20through=20ISO=20technical=20committees.=20Each=20member=20bo=
dy=20interested=20in=20a=20subject=20for=20which=20a=20technical=20committe=
e=20has=20been=20established=20has=20the=20right=20to=20be=20represented=20=
on=20that=20committee.=20International=20organizations,=20governmental=20an=
d=20non-governmental,=20in=20liaison=20with=20ISO,=20also=20take=20part=20i=
n=20the=20work.=20ISO=20collaborates=20closely=20with=20the=20International=
=20Electrotechnical=20Commission=20(IEC)=20on=20all=20matters=20of=20electr=
otechnical=20standardization.</p>=0A<p=20class=3DForewordText>The=20procedu=
res=20used=20to=20develop=20this=20document=20and=20those=20intended=20for=20=
its=20further=20maintenance=20are=20described=20in=20the=20ISO/IEC=20Direct=
ives,=20Part=201.=20In=20particular=20the=20different=20approval=20criteria=
=20needed=20for=20the=20different=20types=20of=20ISO=20documents=20should=20=
be=20noted.=20This=20document=20was=20drafted=20in=20accordance=20with=20th=
e=20editorial=20rules=20of=20the=20ISO/IEC=20Directives,=20Part=202=20(see=20=
www.iso.org/directives).</p>=0A<p=20class=3DForewordText>Attention=20is=20d=
rawn=20to=20the=20possibility=20that=20some=20of=20the=20elements=20of=20th=
is=20document=20may=20be=20the=20subject=20of=20patent=20rights.=20ISO=20sh=
all=20not=20be=20held=20responsible=20for=20identifying=20any=20or=20all=20=
such=20patent=20rights.=20Details=20of=20any=20patent=20rights=20identified=
=20during=20the=20development=20of=20the=20document=20will=20be=20in=20the=20=
Introduction=20and/or=20on=20the=20ISO=20list=20of=20patent=20declarations=20=
received=20(see=20www.iso.org/patents).</p>=0A<p=20class=3DForewordText>Any=
=20trade=20name=20used=20in=20this=20document=20is=20information=20given=20=
for=20the=20convenience=20of=20users=20and=20does=20not=20constitute=20an=20=
endorsement.</p>=0A<p=20class=3DForewordText>For=20an=20explanation=20on=20=
the=20voluntary=20nature=20of=20standards,=20the=20meaning=20of=20ISO=20spe=
cific=20terms=20and=20expressions=20related=20to=20conformity=20assessment,=
=20as=20well=20as=20information=20about=20ISO=E2=80=99s=20adherence=20to=20=
the=20World=20Trade=20Organization=20(WTO)=20principles=20in=20the=20Techni=
cal=20Barriers=20to=20Trade=20(TBT)=20see=20the=20following=20URL:=20www.is=
o.org/iso/foreword.html.</p>=0A<p=20class=3DForewordText>This=20document=20=
was=20prepared=20by=20Technical=20Committee=20ISO/TC=2034,=20<i>Food=20prod=
ucts</i>,=20Subcommittee=20SC=204,=20<i>Cereals=20and=20pulses</i>.</p>=0A<=
p=20class=3DForewordText>This=20second=20edition=20cancels=20and=20replaces=
=20the=20first=20edition=20(ISO=2017301-1:2009),=20which=20has=20been=20tec=
hnically=20revised.</p>=0A<p=20class=3DForewordText>The=20main=20changes=20=
compared=20to=20the=20previous=20edition=20are:</p>=0A<p=20class=3DListCont=
inue1>updated=20normative=20references;</p>=0A<p=20class=3DListContinue1>de=
letion=20of=204.3.</p>=0A<p=20class=3DForewordText>A=20list=20of=20all=20pa=
rts=20in=20the=20ISO=2017301=20series=20can=20be=20found=20on=20the=20ISO=20=
website.</p>=0A<p=20class=3DMsoNormal><br=20clear=3D"all"=20style=3D"mso-sp=
ecial-character:line-break;page-break-before:always"=20/></p>=0A<h1=20class=
=3DIntroTitle>Introduction</h1>=0A<p=20class=3DMsoNormal>This=20document=20=
was=20developed=20in=20response=20to=20worldwide=20demand=20for=20minimum=20=
specifications=20for=20rice=20traded=20internationally,=20since=20most=20co=
mmercial=20bulks=20of=20grain,=20which=20have=20not=20been=20screened=20or=20=
aspirated,=20contain=20a=20proportion=20of=20other=20grains,=20weed=20seeds=
,=20chaff,=20straw,=20stones,=20sand,=20etc.=20The=20vegetable=20materials=20=
can=20have=20physical=20and=20biological=20properties=20which=20differ=20fr=
om=20those=20of=20the=20main=20constituent=20and=20can=20therefore=20affect=
=20the=20storage=20behaviour.</p>=0A<p=20class=3DMsoNormal>Rice=20is=20a=20=
permanent=20host=20to=20a=20considerable=20microflora;=20most=20of=20these=20=
microorganisms=20are=20cosmopolitan,=20the=20majority=20are=20innocuous,=20=
but=20some=20produce=20harmful=20by-products.=20Microflora=20communities=20=
present=20on=20freshly=20harvested=20rice=20include=20many=20types=20of=20b=
acteria,=20moulds=20and=20yeasts.=20While=20the=20rice=20is=20ripening=20an=
d=20its=20moisture=20content=20is=20falling,=20the=20number=20of=20field=20=
microorganisms,=20mainly=20bacteria,=20diminishes.=20When=20the=20rice=20is=
=20harvested,=20it=20is=20invaded=20by=20storage=20microorganisms=20and=20t=
he=20field=20microflora=20gradually=20dies=20out.=20If=20the=20mass=20fract=
ion=20of=20moisture=20(formerly=20expressed=20as=20moisture=20content)=20is=
=20less=20than=2018=20%,=20the=20microflora=20does=20not=20multiply,=20wher=
eas=20above=2018=20%=20it=20does=20so=20rapidly.=20Thus,=20at=20harvest,=20=
the=20qualitative=20and=20the=20quantitative=20composition=20of=20the=20mic=
roflora=20depends=20more=20upon=20ecological=20factors=20than=20upon=20the=20=
variety=20of=20the=20rice.=20During=20transport=20and=20storage,=20addition=
s=20to=20the=20microfloral=20population=20occur.=20Microorganisms=20on=20th=
e=20rice=20at=20harvest=20tend=20to=20die=20out=20during=20storage=20and=20=
are=20replaced=20by=20microorganisms=20adapted=20to=20storage=20conditions.=
</p>=0A<p=20class=3DMsoNormal>Storage=20losses=20have=20been=20estimated=20=
as=20being=20an=20average=20of=205=20%,=20and=20as=20much=20as=2030=20%,=20=
especially=20in=20countries=20with=20climates=20favourable=20to=20the=20rap=
id=20development=20of=20agents=20of=20deterioration=20and=20where=20storage=
=20techniques=20are=20poorly=20developed,=20such=20as=20developing=20countr=
ies=20in=20the=20damp=20tropics.=20The=20magnitude=20of=20these=20figures=20=
highlights=20the=20need=20to=20promote=20throughout=20the=20world=20a=20rap=
id=20improvement=20in=20techniques=20of=20conservation.</p>=0A<p=20class=3D=
MsoNormal>The=20International=20Organization=20for=20Standardization=20(ISO=
)=20draws=20attention=20to=20the=20fact=20that=20it=20is=20claimed=20that=20=
compliance=20with=20this=20document=20may=20involve=20the=20use=20of=20a=20=
patent=20concerning=20sample=20dividers=20given=20in=20<a=20href=3D"#AnnexA=
">Annex=20A</a>=20and=20shown=20in=20<a=20href=3D"#figureA-1">Figure=20A.1<=
/a>.</p>=0A<p=20class=3DMsoNormal>ISO=20takes=20no=20position=20concerning=20=
the=20evidence,=20validity=20and=20scope=20of=20this=20patent=20right.</p>=0A=
<p=20class=3DMsoNormal>The=20holder=20of=20this=20patent=20right=20has=20as=
sured=20ISO=20that=20he/she=20is=20willing=20to=20negotiate=20licences=20un=
der=20reasonable=20and=20non-discriminatory=20terms=20and=20conditions=20wi=
th=20applicants=20throughout=20the=20world.=20In=20this=20respect,=20the=20=
statement=20of=20the=20holder=20of=20this=20patent=20right=20is=20registere=
d=20with=20ISO.=20Information=20may=20be=20obtained=20from:</p>=0A<p=20clas=
s=3DMsoNormal>Vache=20Equipment<br=20/>=20Fictitious<br=20/>=20World<br=20/=
>=20</p>=0A<p=20class=3DMsoNormal>Attention=20is=20drawn=20to=20the=20possi=
bility=20that=20some=20of=20the=20elements=20of=20this=20document=20may=20b=
e=20the=20subject=20of=20patent=20rights=20other=20than=20those=20identifie=
d=20above.=20ISO=20shall=20not=20be=20held=20responsible=20for=20identifyin=
g=20any=20or=20all=20such=20patent=20rights.</p>=0A<p=20class=3DMsoNormal><=
o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>=0A=0A</div>=0A=0A<br=20clear=3D"all"=20class=3D"sectio=
n"=20/>=0A=0A<div=20class=3D>=0A=0A<p=20class=3DMainTitle1>Cereals=20and=20=
pulses=20=E2=80=94=20Specifications=20and=20test=20methods</p>=0A<p=20class=
=3DMainTitle2>Part=C2=A01:=20Rice</p>=0A<h1=20class=3DMsoHeading1>Scope</h1=
>=0A<p=20class=3DMsoNormal>This=20document=20specifies=20minimum=20requirem=
ents=20and=20test=20methods=20for=20rice=20(<i>Oryza=20sativa=20L.</i>).</p=
>=0A<p=20class=3DMsoNormal>It=20is=20applicable=20to=20husked=20rice,=20hus=
ked=20parboiled=20rice,=20milled=20rice=20and=20milled=20parboiled=20rice,=20=
suitable=20for=20human=20consumption,=20directly=20or=20after=20recondition=
ing.</p>=0A<p=20class=3DMsoNormal>It=20is=20not=20applicable=20to=20cooked=20=
rice=20products.</p>=0A<h1=20class=3DMsoHeading1>Normative=20references</h1=
>=0A<p=20class=3DMsoNormal>The=20following=20documents=20are=20referred=20t=
o=20in=20the=20text=20in=20such=20a=20way=20that=20some=20or=20all=20of=20t=
heir=20content=20constitutes=20requirements=20of=20this=20document.=20For=20=
dated=20references,=20only=20the=20edition=20cited=20applies.=20For=20undat=
ed=20references,=20the=20latest=20edition=20of=20the=20referenced=20documen=
t=20(including=20any=20amendments)=20applies.</p>=0A<p=20class=3DRefNorm><s=
pan=20class=3D"stdpublisher0">ISO</span>=20<span=20class=3D"stddocnumber">7=
12</span><span=20class=3D"MsoFootnoteReference"><span=20style=3D"mso-specia=
l-character:footnote"></span></span>=20,=20<span=20class=3D"stddoctitle"><i=
>Cereals=20and=20cereal=20products=E2=80=89=E2=80=94=E2=80=89Determination=20=
of=20moisture=20content=E2=80=89=E2=80=94=E2=80=89Reference=20method</i></s=
pan>.</p>=0A<p=20class=3DBiblioDescription>Withdrawn.</p>=0A<p=20class=3DRe=
fNorm><span=20class=3D"stdpublisher0">ISO</span>=20<span=20class=3D"stddocn=
umber">6646</span>,=20<span=20class=3D"stddoctitle"><i>Rice=E2=80=89=E2=80=94=
=E2=80=89Determination=20of=20the=20potential=20milling=20yield=20from=20pa=
ddy=20and=20from=20husked=20rice</i></span>.</p>=0A<p=20class=3DRefNorm><sp=
an=20class=3D"stdpublisher0">ISO</span>=20<span=20class=3D"stddocnumber">83=
51</span>-<span=20class=3D"stddocpartnumber">1</span>:<span=20class=3D"stdy=
ear">1994</span>,=20<span=20class=3D"stddoctitle"><i>Packaging=E2=80=89=E2=80=
=94=E2=80=89Method=20of=20specification=20for=20sacks=E2=80=89=E2=80=94=E2=80=
=89Part=201:=20Paper=20sacks</i></span>.</p>=0A<p=20class=3DRefNorm><span=20=
class=3D"stdpublisher0">ISO</span>=20<span=20class=3D"stddocnumber">8351</s=
pan>-<span=20class=3D"stddocpartnumber">2</span>,=20<span=20class=3D"stddoc=
title"><i>Packaging=E2=80=89=E2=80=94=E2=80=89Method=20of=20specification=20=
for=20sacks=E2=80=89=E2=80=94=E2=80=89Part=202:=20Sacks=20made=20from=20the=
rmoplastic=20flexible=20film</i></span>.</p>=0A<p=20class=3DRefNorm><span=20=
class=3D"stdpublisher0">ISO</span>=20<span=20class=3D"stddocnumber">16634</=
span>:=E2=80=94<span=20class=3D"MsoFootnoteReference"><span=20style=3D"mso-=
special-character:footnote"></span></span>=20,=20<span=20class=3D"stddoctit=
le"><i>Cereals,=20pulses,=20milled=20cereal=20products,=20oilseeds=20and=20=
animal=20feeding=20stuffs=E2=80=89=E2=80=94=E2=80=89Determination=20of=20th=
e=20total=20nitrogen=20content=20by=20combustion=20according=20to=20the=20D=
umas=20principle=20and=20calculation=20of=20the=20crude=20protein=20content=
</i></span>.</p>=0A<p=20class=3DBiblioDescription>Under=20preparation.=20(S=
tage=20at=20the=20time=20of=20publication=20ISO/DIS=2016634)</p>=0A<p=20cla=
ss=3DRefNorm><span=20class=3D"stdpublisher0">ISO</span>=20<span=20class=3D"=
stddocnumber">20483</span>:<span=20class=3D"stdyear">2013</span>,=20<span=20=
class=3D"stddoctitle"><i>Cereals=20and=20pulses=E2=80=89=E2=80=94=E2=80=89D=
etermination=20of=20the=20nitrogen=20content=20and=20calculation=20of=20the=
=20crude=20protein=20content=E2=80=89=E2=80=94=E2=80=89Kjeldahl=20method</i=
></span>.</p>=0A<p=20class=3DRefNorm><span=20class=3D"stdpublisher0">ISO</s=
pan>=20<span=20class=3D"stddocnumber">24333</span>:<span=20class=3D"stdyear=
