characteristics</h2>=0A<p=20class=3DMsoNormal>Kernels=20of=20rice,=20whethe=
r=20parboiled,=20husked=20or=20milled,=20and=20whether=20whole=20or=20broke=
n,=20shall=20be=20sound,=20clean=20and=20free=20from=20foreign=20odours=20o=
r=20odour=20which=20indicates=20deterioration.</p>=0A<p=20class=3DMsoNormal=
>The=20levels=20of=20additives=20and=20pesticide=20residues=20and=20other=20=
contaminants=20shall=20not=20exceed=20the=20maximum=20limits=20permitted=20=
in=20the=20country=20of=20destination.</p>=0A<p=20class=3DMsoNormal>The=20p=
resence=20of=20living=20insects=20which=20are=20visible=20to=20the=20naked=20=
eye=20is=20not=20permitted.=20This=20should=20be=20determined=20before=20se=
parating=20the=20bulk=20sample=20into=20test=20samples.</p>=0A<h2=20class=3D=
MsoHeading2>Physical=20and=20chemical=20characteristics</h2>=0A<p=20class=3D=
MsoNormal>The=20mass=20fraction=20of=20moisture,=20determined=20in=20accord=
