=20href=3D"#IEC61010-2">IEC=C2=A061010-2:1998</a>,=20shall=20not=20be=20gre=
ater=20than=2015=20%.<span=20class=3D"MsoFootnoteReference"><span=20style=3D=
"mso-special-character:footnote"></span></span></p>=0A<p=20class=3DMsoNorma=
l>The=20mass=20fraction=20of=20extraneous=20matter=20and=20defective=20kern=
