determined=20in=20accordance=20with=20<a=20href=3D"#AnnexA">Annex=20A</a>,=20=
shall=20not=20be=20greater=20than=20the=20values=20specified=20in=20<a=20hr=
ef=3D"#table1">Table=201</a>.</p>=0A<p=20class=3DBox-begin><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p=
></p>=0A<p=20class=3DBox-title>NOTE</p>=0A<p=20class=3DNoteindent>Lower=20m=
