al-character:footnote"></span></span>,=20or=20<a=20href=3D"#ISO20483">ISO=C2=
=A020483:2013</a>.=20For=20details=20on=20the=20determination=20of=20protei=
n=20content=20using=20the=20Kjeldahl=20method,=20see=20Reference=20Referenc=
