#ref16">[16]</a>.</p>=0A<p=20class=3DMsoNormal>Calculate=20the=20crude=20pr=
otein=20content=20of=20the=20dry=20product=20by=20multiplying=20the=20value=
=20of=20the=20nitrogen=20content=20by=20the=20conversion=20factor=20specifi=
ed=20in=20<a=20href=3D"#ISO20483">ISO=C2=A020483:2013,=20Annex=20C=20and=20=
Table=20C.1</a>,=20that=20is=20adapted=20to=20the=20type=20of=20cereals=20o=
r=20pulses=20Reference=20<a=20href=3D"#ref13">[11]</a>Reference=20<a=20href=
=3D"#ref14">[12]</a>=20and=20to=20their=20use.</p>=0A<h2=20class=3DMsoHeadi=
ng2>Gelatinization=20time</h2>=0A<p=20class=3DMsoNormal>Determine=20the=20g=
elatinization=20time,=20,=20for=20rice=20kernels=20during=20cooking.=20An=20=
example=20of=20a=20typical=20curve=20is=20given=20in=20<a=20href=3D"#figure=
C-1">Figure=20C.1</a>.=20Three=20typical=20stages=20of=20gelatinization=20a=
re=20shown=20in=20<a=20href=3D"#figureC-2">Figure=20C.2</a>.</p>=0A<p=20cla=
ss=3DMsoNormal>Report=20the=20results=20as=20specified=20in=20<a=20href=3D"=
#clause7">Clause=207</a>.</p>=0A<h2=20class=3DMsoHeading2>Husked=20rice=20y=
