it.</p>=0A<h1=20class=3DMsoHeading1>Test=20report</h1>=0A<p=20class=3DMsoNo=
rmal>For=20each=20test=20method,=20the=20test=20report=20shall=20specify=20=
the=20following:</p>=0A<p=20class=3DMsoNormal>all=20information=20necessary=
=20for=20the=20complete=20identification=20of=20the=20sample;</p>=0A<p=20cl=
ass=3DMsoNormal>a=20reference=20to=20this=20document=20(i.e.=20ISO=2017301-=
1);</p>=0A<p=20class=3DMsoNormal>the=20sampling=20method=20used;</p>=0A<p=20=
class=3DMsoNormal>the=20test=20method=20used;</p>=0A<p=20class=3DMsoNormal>=
the=20test=20result(s)=20obtained=20or,=20if=20the=20repeatability=20has=20=
been=20checked,=20the=20final=20quoted=20result=20obtained;</p>=0A<p=20clas=
s=3DMsoNormal>all=20operating=20details=20not=20specified=20in=20this=20doc=
ument,=20or=20regarded=20as=20optional,=20together=20with=20details=20of=20=
any=20incidents=20which=20may=20have=20influenced=20the=20test=20result(s);=
</p>=0A<p=20class=3DMsoNormal>any=20unusual=20features=20(anomalies)=20obse=
rved=20during=20the=20test;</p>=0A<p=20class=3DMsoNormal>the=20date=20of=20=
the=20test.</p>=0A<h1=20class=3DMsoHeading1>Packaging</h1>=0A<p=20class=3DM=
soNormal>The=20packaging=20shall=20not=20transmit=20any=20odour=20or=20flav=
our=20to=20the=20product=20and=20shall=20not=20contain=20substances=20which=
=20may=20damage=20the=20product=20or=20constitute=20a=20health=20risk.</p>=0A=
<p=20class=3DMsoNormal>If=20bags=20are=20used,=20they=20shall=20comply=20wi=
th=20the=20requirements=20of=20<a=20href=3D"#ISO8351-1">ISO=C2=A08351-1:199=
4,=20Clause=209</a>,=20or=20<a=20href=3D"#ISO8351-2">ISO=C2=A08351-2</a>,=20=
as=20appropriate.</p>=0A<h1=20class=3DMsoHeading1>Marking</h1>=0A<p=20class=
=3DMsoNormal>The=20packages=20shall=20be=20marked=20or=20labelled=20as=20re=
quired=20by=20the=20country=20of=20destination.</p>=0A<p=20class=3DMsoNorma=
l><br=20clear=3D"all"=20style=3D"mso-special-character:line-break;page-brea=
k-before:always"=20/></p>=0A<h1=20class=3DANNEX><br=20/>(normative)<b>Deter=
mination=20of=20defects</b></h1>=0A<p=20class=3Da2>Principle</p>=0A<p=20cla=
ss=3DMsoNormal>Extraneous=20matter,=20broken=20kernels,=20damaged=20kernels=
=20and=20other=20kinds=20of=20rice=20are=20separated=20manually=20according=
=20to=20the=20following=20types:=20husked=20rice,=20milled=20rice,=20husked=
=20parboiled=20rice=20and=20milled=20parboiled=20rice.=20Each=20type=20is=20=
then=20weighed.</p>=0A<p=20class=3Da2>Apparatus</p>=0A<p=20class=3DMsoNorma=
l>The=20usual=20laboratory=20apparatus=20and,=20in=20particular,=20the=20fo=
llowing.</p>=0A<p=20class=3Da3>Sample=20divider,</p>=0A<p=20class=3DMsoNorm=
al>consisting=20of=20a=20conical=20sample=20divider=20or=20multiple-slot=20=
sample=20divider=20with=20a=20distribution=20system,=20e.g.=20=E2=80=9CSpli=
t-it-right=E2=80=9D=20sample=20divider,=20such=20as=20that=20shown=20in=20<=
a=20href=3D"#figureA-1">Figure=20A.1</a>.</p>=0A<p=20class=3Da3>Sieve,</p>=0A=
<p=20class=3DMsoNormal>with=20round=20perforations=20of=20diameter=201,4=20=
mm.</p>=0A<p=20class=3Da3>Tweezers.</p>=0A<p=20class=3Da3>Scalpel.</p>=0A<p=
=20class=3Da3>Paintbrush.</p>=0A<p=20class=3Da3>Steel=20bowls,</p>=0A<p=20c=
lass=3DMsoNormal>of=20diameter=20100=20mm=20=C2=B1=205=20mm;=20seven=20per=20=
test=20sample.</p>=0A<p=20class=3Da3>Balance,</p>=0A<p=20class=3DMsoNormal>=
which=20can=20be=20read=20to=20the=20nearest=200,01=20g.</p>=0A<p=20class=3D=
a2>Sampling</p>=0A<p=20class=3DMsoNormal>See=20<a=20href=3D"#clause5">Claus=
e=205</a>.</p>=0A<p=20class=3Da2>Procedure</p>=0A<p=20class=3Da3>Preparatio=
n=20of=20test=20sample</p>=0A<p=20class=3DMsoNormal>Carefully=20mix=20the=20=
laboratory=20sample=20to=20make=20it=20as=20uniform=20as=20possible,=20then=
=20proceed=20to=20reduce=20it,=20using=20a=20divider=20(<a=20href=3D"#Annex=
A-2-1">A.2.1</a>),=20until=20a=20quantity=20of=20about=2030=20g=20is=20obta=
ined.</p>=0A<p=20class=3DMsoNormal>All=20parts=20of=20kernels=20which=20get=
=20stuck=20in=20the=20perforations=20of=20a=20sieve=20should=20be=20conside=
red=20to=20be=20retained=20by=20the=20sieve.</p>=0A<p=20class=3DFigureGraph=
ic><img=20src=3D"media/img20261108-397-pwreto.png"=20style=3D'width:243px;h=
eight:184px'></p>=0A<p=20class=3DFiguretitle>Figure=20A.1=C2=A0=E2=80=94=20=
Split-it-right=20sample=20divider</p>=0A<p=20class=3Da2>Determination</p>=0A=
<p=20class=3DMsoNormal>Weigh,=20to=20the=20nearest=200,1=20g,=20one=20of=20=
the=20test=20samples=20obtained=20in=20accordance=20with=20<a=20href=3D"#An=
nexA-4-1">A.4.1</a>=20and=20separate=20the=20different=20defects=20into=20t=
he=20bowls=20(<a=20href=3D"#AnnexA-2-6">A.2.6</a>).=20When=20a=20kernel=20h=
as=20several=20defects,=20classify=20it=20in=20the=20defect=20category=20fo=
r=20which=20the=20maximum=20permissible=20value=20is=20the=20lowest=20(see=20=
<a=20href=3D"#table1">Table=201</a>).</p>=0A<p=20class=3DMsoNormal>Weigh,=20=
to=20the=20nearest=200,01=20g,=20the=20fractions=20so=20obtained.</p>=0A<p=20=
class=3Da2>Calculation</p>=0A<p=20class=3DMsoNormal>Express=20the=20mass=20=
fraction=20of=20each=20defect=20using=20<a=20href=3D"#formulaA-1">Formula=20=
(A.1)</a>:</p>=0A<p=20class=3DFormula><span=20class=3D"stem"><m:oMathPara>=0A=
=20=20<m:oMath>=0A=20=20=20=20<m:r>=0A=20=20=20=20=20=20<m:t>w</m:t>=0A=20=20=
=20=20</m:r>=0A=20=20=20=20<m:r>=0A=20=20=20=20=20=20<m:t>=3D</m:t>=0A=20=20=
=20=20</m:r>=0A=20=20=20=20<m:f>=0A=20=20=20=20=20=20<m:fPr>=0A=20=20=20=20=
