soNormal>Report=20the=20results=20as=20specified=20in=20<a=20href=3D"#claus=
e7">Clause=207</a>.</p>=0A<p=20class=3DMsoNormal><br=20clear=3D"all"=20styl=
e=3D"mso-special-character:line-break;page-break-before:always"=20/></p>=0A=
<h1=20class=3DANNEX><br=20/>(informative)<b>Determination=20of=20the=20waxy=
=20rice=20content=20of=20parboiled=20rice</b></h1>=0A<p=20class=3Da2>Princi=
ple</p>=0A<p=20class=3DMsoNormal>Waxy=20rice=20kernels=20have=20a=20reddish=
=20brown=20colour=20when=20stained=20in=20an=20iodine=20solution,=20while=20=
non-waxy=20rice=20kernels=20show=20a=20dark=20blue=20colour.</p>=0A<p=20cla=
ss=3Da2>Apparatus</p>=0A<p=20class=3DMsoNormal>The=20usual=20laboratory=20a=
pparatus=20and,=20in=20particular,=20the=20following.</p>=0A<p=20class=3Da3=
>Balance,</p>=0A<p=20class=3DMsoNormal>capable=20of=20weighing=20to=20the=20=
nearest=200,01=20g.</p>=0A<p=20class=3Da3>Glass=20beaker,</p>=0A<p=20class=3D=
MsoNormal>of=20capacity=20250=20ml.</p>=0A<p=20class=3Da3>Small=20white=20c=
olour=20bowls,</p>=0A<p=20class=3DMsoNormal>or=20any=20white=20colour=20con=
tainer=20of=20a=20suitable=20size.</p>=0A<p=20class=3Da3>Wire=20sieve,</p>=0A=
<p=20class=3DMsoNormal>with=20long=20rounded=20apertures=20of=20=20=20=20=20=
=20.</p>=0A<p=20class=3Da3>Stirrer=20rod.</p>=0A<p=20class=3Da3>Tweezers=20=
or=20forceps.</p>=0A<p=20class=3Da3>Tissue=20paper.</p>=0A<p=20class=3Da2>R=
eagents</p>=0A<p=20class=3DBox-begin><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>=0A<p=20class=3DW=
arningtitle>WARNING=20=E2=80=94=20</p>=0A<p=20class=3DWarningtext>Direct=20=
contact=20of=20iodine=20with=20skin=20can=20cause=20lesions=20so=20care=20s=
hould=20be=20taken=20in=20handling=20iodine.=20Iodine=20vapour=20is=20very=20=
irritating=20to=20eyes=20and=20mucous=20membranes.</p>=0A<p=20class=3DBox-e=
nd><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>=0A<p=20class=3Da3>Deionized=20water,</p>=0A<p=20cl=
ass=3DMsoNormal>Grade=203=20quality=20as=20specified=20in=20<a=20href=3D"#I=
SO3696">ISO=C2=A03696</a>.</p>=0A<p=20class=3Da3>Iodine=20stock=20solution,=
</p>=0A<p=20class=3DMsoNormal>containing=20a=20mass=20fraction=20of=204,1=20=
%=20iodine=20and=206,3=20%=20potassium=20iodide=20in=20deionized=20water=20=
such=20as=20Lugols.<span=20class=3D"MsoFootnoteReference"><span=20style=3D"=
mso-special-character:footnote"></span></span></p>=0A<p=20class=3Da3>Iodine=
=20working=20solution,</p>=0A<p=20class=3DMsoNormal>obtained=20by=20dilutin=
g=20the=20stock=20solution=20(<a=20href=3D"#AnnexB-3-2">B.3.2</a>)=20two=20=
times=20(by=20volume)=20with=20deionized=20water=20(<a=20href=3D"#AnnexB-3-=
1">B.3.1</a>).</p>=0A<p=20class=3DMsoNormal>Prepare=20fresh=20daily.</p>=0A=
<p=20class=3Da2>Sampling</p>=0A<p=20class=3DMsoNormal>Sampling=20shall=20be=
=20carried=20out=20in=20accordance=20with=20<a=20href=3D"#clause5">Clause=20=
5</a>.</p>=0A<p=20class=3Da2>Determination</p>=0A<p=20class=3DMsoNormal>Wei=
gh=20a=20portion=20of=20about=20100=20g=20of=20milled=20rice=20and=20put=20=
it=20into=20a=20glass=20beaker=20(<a=20href=3D"#AnnexB-2-2">B.2.2</a>).</p>=
=0A<p=20class=3DMsoNormal>Add=20enough=20iodine=20working=20solution=20(<a=20=
href=3D"#AnnexB-3-3">B.3.3</a>)=20to=20soak=20the=20kernels,=20and=20stir=20=
(<a=20href=3D"#AnnexB-2-5">B.2.5</a>)=20until=20all=20the=20kernels=20are=20=
submerged=20under=20the=20solution.=20Let=20the=20kernels=20soak=20in=20the=
=20solution=20for=2030=20s.</p>=0A<p=20class=3DMsoNormal>Pour=20the=20rice=20=
and=20solution=20into=20a=20wire=20sieve=20(<a=20href=3D"#AnnexB-2-4">B.2.4=
</a>),=20and=20shake=20the=20basket=20slightly=20in=20order=20to=20drain=20=
out=20the=20solution.=20Then=20place=20the=20wire=20sieve=20on=20a=20piece=20=
of=20tissue=20paper=20(<a=20href=3D"#AnnexB-2-7">B.2.7</a>)=20to=20absorb=20=
the=20excess=20liquid.</p>=0A<p=20class=3DMsoNormal>Pour=20the=20stained=20=
kernels=20into=20a=20bowl=20(<a=20href=3D"#AnnexB-2-3">B.2.3</a>).=20Using=20=
tweezers=20or=20forceps=20(<a=20href=3D"#AnnexB-2-6">B.2.6</a>),=20separate=
=20the=20reddish=20brown=20kernels=20of=20waxy=20rice=20from=20the=20dark=20=
blue=20kernels=20of=20non-waxy=20rice.</p>=0A<p=20class=3DMsoNormal>Weigh=20=
the=20waxy=20rice=20portion=20()=20and=20the=20non-waxy=20rice=20portion=20=
()=20to=20the=20nearest=200,1=20g.</p>=0A<p=20class=3Da2>Calculation</p>=0A=
<p=20class=3DMsoNormal>Calculate=20the=20mass=20fraction,=20expressed=20as=20=
a=20percentage,=20of=20the=20waxy=20rice,=20,=20using=20<a=20href=3D"#formu=
laB-1">Formula=20(B.1)</a>:</p>=0A<p=20class=3DFormula><span=20class=3D"ste=
m"><m:oMathPara>=0A=20=20<m:oMath>=0A=20=20=20=20<m:sSub>=0A=20=20=20=20=20=
=20<m:sSubPr>=0A=20=20=20=20=20=20=20=20<m:ctrlPr>=0A=20=20=20=20=20=20=20=20=
=20=20<w:rPr>=0A=20=20=20=20=20=20=20=20=20=20=20=20<w:rFonts=20w:ascii=3D"=
Cambria=20Math"=20w:hAnsi=3D"Cambria=20Math"/>=0A=20=20=20=20=20=20=20=20=20=
